<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Florsheim Group started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Florsheim Group started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw said it initiated coverage of Florsheim Group Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said set a $20 price target on the stock, based on the shares trading in line with the multiple assigned to the S&amp;P 400 and the brokerage's 1998 earnings estimate on the company of $0.93.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1-1/8 at 10-1/2.</p>
</text>
